      "text": "To solve the given problem, we start with the equation:\n\n\\[ x^{2017} - 2x + 1 = 0 \\]\n\nWe need to find the value of the expression:\n\n\\[ x^{2016} + x^{2015} + \\dots + x + 1 \\]\n\nLet's define a new variable for the sum:\n\n\\[ S = x^{2016} + x^{2015} + \\dots + x + 1 \\]\n\nWe can rewrite \\( S \\) using the properties of exponents and the given equation. Notice that:\n\n\\[ S = x^{2016} + x^{2015} + \\dots + x + 1 \\]\n\nWe know that:\n\n\\[ x^{2017} = 2x - 1 \\]\n\nThis can be derived from the given equation by substituting \\( x^{2017} \\) in the equation:\n\n\\[ x^{2017} - 2x + 1 = 0 \\implies x^{2016}x - 2x + 1 = 0 \\implies x^{2016}x - 2x + 1 = 0 \\implies x^{2016}(x - 2) + 1 = 0 \\implies x^{2016}(x - 2) = -1 \\implies x^{2016} = \\frac{-1}{x-2} \\]\n\nNow, let's express \\( S \\) in terms of \\( x \\):\n\n\\[ S = x^{2016} + x^{2015} + \\dots + x + 1 \\]\n\nWe can factor out the common term \\( x^{2016} \\):\n\n\\[ S = x^{2016} + x^{2015} + \\dots + x + 1 = \\frac{-1}{x-2} + \\frac{x^{2017}}{x-2} + \\dots + \\frac{x^1}{x-2} + 1 \\]\n\nNotice that the middle terms cancel out, leaving us with:\n\n\\[ S = \\frac{-1 + x - 1 + x^2 - 1 + x^3 - \\dots + x^{2016}}{x-2} + 1 \\]\n\nThe numerator is a geometric series:\n\n\\[ -1 + x - 1 + x^2 - 1 + x^3 - \\dots + x^{2016} = -20 - (x^1 + x^2 + x^3 + \\dots + x^{2016}) \\]\n\nThe sum of the geometric series \\( x^1 + x^2 + x^3 + \\dots + x^{2016} \\) is:\n\n\\[ \\sum_{k=1}^{2016} x^k = \\frac{x(1 - x^{2016})}{1 - x} = \\frac{x(1 - x^{2016})}{1 - x} = \\frac{x - x^{2017}}{1 - x} = \\frac{x - (2x - 1)}{1 - x} = \\frac{x - 2x + 1}{1 - x} = \\frac{1 - x}{1 - x} = 1 \\]\n\nSo the numerator simplifies to:\n\n\\[ -1 - (x^1 + x^2 + x^3 + \\dots + x^{2016}) = -1 - 1 = -2 \\]\n\nThus, the expression for \\( S \\) becomes:\n\n\\[ S = \\frac{-2}{x-2} + 1 = \\frac{-2 + (x-2)}{x-2} = \\frac{x - 4}{x-2} \\]\n\nSince \\( x^{2017} = 2x - 1 \\), we can substitute \\( x^{2017} \\) back into the equation:\n\n\\[ S = \\frac{x - 4}{x-2} = \\frac{x - 4}{x-2} \\]\n\nTherefore, the value of the given expression is:\n\n\\[ \\boxed{2} \\]",
